%% archify:relationships rel-cli-renderers, rel-cli-checker, rel-cli-artifact, rel-cli-reverse, rel-renderers-runtime, rel-runtime-validators, rel-runtime-evidence, rel-evidence-git, rel-reverse-git
flowchart LR
    cli[Archify CLI]
    renderers[Typed renderers]
    runtime[Shared renderer runtime]
    validators[Standalone schema validators]
    evidence[Repository evidence verifier]
    checker[Final artifact checker]
    reverse[Reverse Docs-as-Code pipeline]
    artifact[(Delivered HTML artifact)]
    git[Git]

    cli -->|spawns renderer process| renderers
    renderers -->|loadDiagram, writeDiagram| runtime
    runtime -->|validateSchema| validators
    runtime -->|verifyRepositoryEvidence| evidence
    evidence -->|process| git
    cli -->|checks candidate| checker
    cli -->|renames verified candidate| artifact
    cli -->|reverse validate, freeze| reverse
    reverse -->|resolves evidence at revision| git
